## Extracted Lemma Shape
  For every audited primitive covering row, E_safe has at least one survivor
  component outside B0_odd cap B1_odd.  The obstruction complement is not
  featureless: each bad-core component carries exact minimal odd-owner
  covers on both branches plus endpoint wall labels.
  Proof target: a full counterexample would require gluing these local
  minimal covers across all E components.  The extracted ledger says the
  gluing must keep branch owner words and even endpoint gates; harmonic
  tails, raw bad measure, or topology-only summaries are illegal shortcuts
  unless they reconstruct or route those sidecars.

